OL,5,G2230 Lemn Sissay's Origin Stories
OL,6,     F2/4. Poet Lemn Sissay's comic and
OL,7,     Fpoetic look at the treatment of
OL,8,     Fchildren raised in care, based on
OL,9,     Fhis own experiences. From 2016.
OL,10,G2300 Hearing With Hegley
OL,11,     F4/8. The Luton laureate visits the
OL,12,     FCheltenham Literary Festival, and
OL,13,     Ffinds that some poems just don't
OL,14,     Fwant to be read. From February
OL,15,     F2000.
OL,16,G2315 Irish Micks and Legends
OL,17,     F4/4. Writers and performers
OL,18,     FAisling Bea and Yasmine Akram
OL,19,     Fbring some of Ireland's most
OL,20,     Fpopular folklore to life. From
OL,21,     F2012.
